    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going to let them use us for nothing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What's gonna happen if they really start calling themselves Reunion?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "They definitely will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll be hunted down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "A town of this size can't do anything to us. But... What if it was an entire nomadic city?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If we took just one of the big Leithanian bankers, musicians, or aristocrats out of their fancy towers, we'd be set for life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Pride will ruin them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the same pride that keeps Leithanien's aggressive streak in check.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should avoid making trouble in Wolumonde. We will have nowhere else to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "We should not meet on the battlefield. This... this is no battlefield. Is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "You, all of you, your time grows short.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Um...? Who are you talking to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sarkaz Warrior"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_011#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_053",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just... musing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "text": "Winter is coming. And we will have no choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mudrock"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_black",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Ugh... I've got a bad feeling about this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Click"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, any more questions?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Just to be sure, how did you identify the eight corpses, Officer Severin?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Body type, sex, approximate age, a list of the town's missing persons.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "But now is not the time to discuss the fire. We have more pressing issues at hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't disagree, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "What have you got?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "name2": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The number of Infected people who lost their lives in the fire was 'four,' according to the Reunion member we spoke to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there a reason we should care what the enemy has to say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "With all due respect, this does matter. 'Caring' what he says is different from 'trusting' it. We have a major risk of misunderstanding here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I still don't think this will solve the problem. Uncovering the truth about the fire will not improve our situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It means a lot to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then, with all due respect, Miss Folinic, you've been letting your emotions pull you around too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But you must\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I fight for Wolumonde and Wolumonde alone. That is my duty. I'm not here to serve the justice in your heart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have a responsibility to give the truth to Rhodes Island, not your thirst for revenge.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_345_folnic_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014No, you're right...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to go calm down... I, I'll go help Lisa with the wounded.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Folinic"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then it's settled. Our top priority is to retake Zw\u00f6lftontechnik Strasse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "War is inevitable, at this point. Rhodes Island will need to focus on the fight for the automated Arts units, all while keeping a close eye on the Sarkaz and other partisans.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "Direct crowd control will be on us. The most difficult jobs, we give to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ayerscarpe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_294_ayer",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Erm, did I say too much?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_066",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No. Tell me, what did you see in their eyes? The insurgents, and the angry townspeople.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they managed to overwhelm us, that would be the end of the town of Wolumonde.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "And regardless of what the truth may be, headlines around the world would read 'Reunion resurfaces and destroys a town in Leithanien.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "After so many sacrifices, so many goodbyes, I did not want to see it happen again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_367_swllow_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ayerscarpe, contact Click. It's time to regroup.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm going to check on the Infected captives.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "GreyThroat"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Schultz? I saw Miss Folinic already left. Is the meeting over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tatjana"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_066",
        "name2": "avg_npc_069#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're getting loud out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Severin"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 3
    },
    {
