    },
    {
        "text": "Mmm\u2014\u2014\u266a Mmmhmm\u2014\u2014\u266a"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such a brittle little branch\u266a"
    },
    {
        "text": "Winterwisp, oh, Winterwisp\u266a"
    },
    {
        "text": "Weary of a long life, weary of a long death\u266a"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sing out your song, firm and strong~\u266a"
    },
    {
        "text": "Singing through summer~\u266a"
    },
    {
        "text": "And on through winter~\u266a"
    },
    {
        "text": "Winterwisp, oh, Winterwisp~\u266a"
    },
